[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13200.469, "timestamp": "03:40:00", "text": "对对对，部落文化里的东西。是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13201.99, "timestamp": "03:40:01", "text": "就是这个词，它就像一种部落语言"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13204.389, "timestamp": "03:40:04", "text": "你知道的那玩意儿。所以，这就来了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13207.83, "timestamp": "03:40:07", "text": "来自 J，那是拉贾斯坦邦的一个地方。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13210.229, "timestamp": "03:40:10", "text": "好的。所以，因为这个原因，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13212.71, "timestamp": "03:40:12", "text": "就像我理解拉贾斯坦邦语一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13214.389, "timestamp": "03:40:14", "text": "很多。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13219.03, "timestamp": "03:40:19", "text": "就像是从母亲那边传下来的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13223.83, "timestamp": "03:40:23", "text": "我记得在历史课上学过这个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13226.309, "timestamp": "03:40:26", "text": "是的。是的。就像……呃，在我……期间"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13228.71, "timestamp": "03:40:28", "text": "就像八年级的历史课一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13231.03, "timestamp": "03:40:31", "text": "像我的朋友这样的人会来"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13232.79, "timestamp": "03:40:32", "text": "这取决于我，就像，是的，这就是你，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13235.83, "timestamp": "03:40:35", "text": "这个，这个，就是你，对吧，他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13237.75, "timestamp": "03:40:37", "text": "就像每一个人一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13239.75, "timestamp": "03:40:39", "text": "比如有一次我们学习关于chas和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13241.75, "timestamp": "03:40:41", "text": "他们说“这就是你”，我说“不”。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13243.59, "timestamp": "03:40:43", "text": "然后还有……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13247.11, "timestamp": "03:40:47", "text": "我感觉自己好像什么都不是。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13249.83, "timestamp": "03:40:49", "text": "它是独立的，但它就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13252.95, "timestamp": "03:40:52", "text": "你知道，这是些随机信息，嗯，就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13256.309, "timestamp": "03:40:56", "text": "太好了，我学到了更多。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13259.269, "timestamp": "03:40:59", "text": "现在"}]